Description: mgr: dashboard, cephadm and restful without in-process PyO3 imports
 The rest of https://github.com/ceph/ceph/pull/66794 for Squid:
  - dashboard: verify password hashes through the crypto caller instead of
    importing bcrypt, select the caller with the crypto_caller option
    (default: remote, i.e. a child process)
  - cephadm: use the internal caller, it needs cryptography in-process for
    asyncssh anyway
 restful, which Tentacle no longer has, imported pyOpenSSL at the top to
 create its certificate; create it through mgr_util as well.
